  "passage": {
    "passage_text": "Lily was in her room, playing with her favorite toy, a stuffed bunny named Bun-Bun. She loved Bun-Bun very much. Suddenly, while playing, Bun-Bun's ear ripped. Lily gasped. She felt very upset and worried.\n\nHolding the ripped toy, Lily rushed to her mother. \"Mom, Bun-Bun's ear is ripped. Can you help me fix it?\" she asked, tears welling in her eyes.\n\nHer mother nodded and quickly fetched her sewing kit. Carefully, she sewed Bun-Bun's ear back on. Lily watched nervously.\n\nWhen her mother finished, she handed Bun-Bun back to Lily. The bunny's ear was fixed! Lily hugged Bun-Bun tightly, feeling relieved. \"Thank you, mom,\" she said, her face lighting up with joy. Lily was happy again, and so was Bun-Bun.",
    "passage_title": "Title: Lily and the Torn Bunny Ear",
